  "solution": {
    "text": "Photochemical smog is formed on the chemical reaction of sunlight, nitrogen oxides and volatile organic compounds in the atmosphere.<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Oxygen atom (nascent) is very reactive and combines with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo></math>in air to produce ozone.<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
